<title>USA: BankAtlantic sets five-for-four split.</title>
<headline>BankAtlantic sets five-for-four split.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAtlantic Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday that it set a five-for-four stock split in the form of a 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable in Class A stock to both Class A and Class B shareholders of record as of August 1, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>The payment date is August 18.  </p>
<p>The company said that after the split there will be 11,765,117 Class A shares outstanding. The number of Class B shares will remain unchanged at 10,708,000.</p>
</text>
